                    <hi rendition="#italic">Supra.</hi>
                </p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d474-f2" n="24" xml:id="d474-f2-content">
                <p>Brig. Gen. John P. McConnell, Commanding General, Air Division Headquarters of
                    the Nanking Headquarters Command.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d474-f3" n="25" xml:id="d474-f3-content">
                <p>Air Lt. Gen. Chou Chih-jou.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
